# Keep developer documentation out of Composer dist packages.
#
# docs/ is reference material for developers and the implementation team; none of it is
# loaded at runtime. It also carries internal architecture detail that has no business
# sitting on a production server. Reading it requires git auth against this repo, which
# is the intended access path.
#
# export-ignore applies to `git archive`, and therefore to Composer dist installs
# (the stack sets "preferred-install": "dist"). It does NOT apply to --prefer-source,
# `git clone`, or rsync-based deploys from a working tree.
/docs export-ignore
